{"id":171,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"信条教育で育つ天理中高一貫教育","feature_description":"天理中学校は、天理教教義に基づく信条教育を通じて、よふぼくとしての資質を育てる学校です。『朝起き 正直 働き』をめどうに、自ら学ぶ姿勢、ものを大切にする心、思いやりと奉仕の精神を育て、宗教行事と部活動を大切にしています。教育基本法と学校教育法に則った中等普通教育も柱で、学びと生活の両面から人を育てる構成です。礼節と奉仕を重んじる校風です。","clubs":[{"id":3027,"name":"コーラス","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.tenri-j.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3028,"name":"吹奏楽","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.tenri-j.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3029,"name":"弦楽","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.tenri-j.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3030,"name":"美術","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.tenri-j.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3031,"name":"箏曲","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.tenri-j.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3032,"name":"ESS","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.tenri-j.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3033,"name":"コンピュータ","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.tenri-j.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3034,"name":"野球","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tenri-j.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3035,"name":"ラグビー","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tenri-j.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3036,"name":"バレーボール男子","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tenri-j.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3037,"name":"バレーボール女子","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tenri-j.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3038,"name":"バスケットボール男子","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tenri-j.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3039,"name":"バスケットボール女子","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tenri-j.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},